name: sim.unloadModule
description: 
luaSynopsis: int result=sim.unloadModule(int pluginHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. pluginhandle: handle of the plugin
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. 0 if plugin was not unloaded (e.g. because it was not loaded, or because it was loaded more than once). Different from 0 if the plugin was successfully unloaded
